WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 25]

01:43.000 --> 01:43.800
How much is it?

01:44.700 --> 01:45.180
Miss,

01:45.580 --> 01:47.420
this bracelet is unusual.

01:48.100 --> 01:49.229
This pearl is made of

01:49.780 --> 01:51.740
the Lake Demon's eye.

01:51.900 --> 01:53.620
She dug out one of her eyes for her children

01:53.620 --> 01:55.420
and raised it in the golden clam.

01:55.500 --> 01:56.700
It can repel demons and suppress evil spirits.

01:56.700 --> 01:58.100
It will definitely work.

01:58.340 --> 02:00.060
-Liar. -He made it up.

02:01.100 --> 02:02.580
What are you talking about?

02:02.580 --> 02:03.740
You know nothing.

02:08.850 --> 02:10.020
Why do I think

02:11.300 --> 02:12.460
someone will buy it?

02:14.090 --> 02:14.820
5,000 taels.

02:18.220 --> 02:18.880
I'll buy it.

02:32.540 --> 02:33.870
Don't let the Lake Demon

02:34.140 --> 02:35.420
dig out another eye

02:36.220 --> 02:37.950
for her children in the winter.

02:41.980 --> 02:42.700
Miss.

02:44.300 --> 02:45.660
It's you

02:46.180 --> 02:47.440
I've been waiting for.

02:50.579 --> 02:51.660
You don't know me?

02:52.540 --> 02:53.380
I...

02:54.180 --> 02:55.180
suppose.

02:57.620 --> 02:59.260
I remember last night

03:00.460 --> 03:02.920
when I was pulled out of the water last night,

03:05.780 --> 03:06.780
I seem to remember

03:07.020 --> 03:07.660
I told someone

03:07.660 --> 03:09.220
about the Lake Demon here.

03:11.500 --> 03:12.620
I gave this pearl

03:13.180 --> 03:14.260
to a girl.

03:15.620 --> 03:16.460
That girl...

03:19.340 --> 03:20.540
That girl is me.

03:22.340 --> 03:23.450
My name is Liu Shao.

03:25.260 --> 03:25.940
You are...

03:34.620 --> 03:35.420
Luo Ge.

03:39.020 --> 03:39.900
Liu Shao.

03:42.020 --> 03:44.079
The moon rose to the tip of the willow.

03:45.900 --> 03:47.940
The moon rose to the tip of the willow.

03:47.940 --> 03:48.900
Good name.

03:49.660 --> 03:50.740
Good name.

03:53.260 --> 03:53.780
You...

03:54.780 --> 03:55.940
What did you call me?

03:57.620 --> 03:58.260
Luo Ge.

04:01.740 --> 04:02.580
Luo Ge.

04:05.670 --> 04:08.250
♫This is a spring song♫

04:07.060 --> 04:08.540
You forgot everything.

04:09.410 --> 04:11.890
♫The peach blossoms fly with the swallow♫

04:09.620 --> 04:12.080
How can you break the Soul-devouring Spell?

04:12.700 --> 04:14.340
I really can't remember that.

04:12.980 --> 04:18.079
♫Whose lights are light and shine people's way home?♫

04:15.460 --> 04:17.390
I think I saw it when I was floating.

04:17.940 --> 04:18.740
I remember

04:18.940 --> 04:20.060
I owe it to someone.

04:20.320 --> 04:23.010
♫The clouds roll the sunset♫

04:20.420 --> 04:20.899
So...

04:20.980 --> 04:22.340
So I grabbed it.

04:24.090 --> 04:26.550
♫The moon kisses the eyebrows♫

04:26.550 --> 04:28.770
♫I am waiting for you to say♫

04:28.770 --> 04:32.790
♫Tonight in this life♫

04:31.700 --> 04:32.580
Sorry.

04:33.690 --> 04:37.600
♫Ask the flowing water whether it knows the red leaves♫

04:34.050 --> 04:34.980
I broke

04:35.260 --> 04:36.790
the treasure Lu Li left you.

04:37.600 --> 04:41.180
♫I miss you so much♫

04:40.740 --> 04:41.060
No.

04:41.180 --> 04:43.659
♫I still remember the youth♫

04:42.780 --> 04:43.580
What's wrong?

04:44.420 --> 04:47.770
♫I laughed and hated getting old♫

04:46.260 --> 04:46.720
This...

04:47.380 --> 04:48.659
I owe you this?

04:48.540 --> 04:51.370
♫Flowers bloom alone. The fragrance fills the path♫

04:50.140 --> 04:50.860
I'm sorry.

04:51.140 --> 04:51.540
Here...

04:51.370 --> 04:53.300
♫Look at the stars from faraway♫

04:51.540 --> 04:52.180
This...

04:52.180 --> 04:53.040
This is for you.

04:53.659 --> 04:55.980
♫The chaos of knowing love♫

04:55.820 --> 04:56.820
And this too.

04:55.980 --> 04:58.790
♫The South Wind folds a little red♫

04:57.260 --> 04:58.210
Take these.

04:59.130 --> 05:02.270
♫Send you to the Western State♫

04:59.340 --> 05:00.300
It's all yours.

05:01.620 --> 05:02.860
Don't cry, okay?

05:03.400 --> 05:06.160
♫Wild geese pass the mountains and the sea♫

05:06.160 --> 05:08.460
♫I am rushing to a dream♫

05:08.460 --> 05:10.700
♫The fate of three lifetimes♫

05:10.700 --> 05:11.720
♫Appreciate with our hands tied♫

05:11.720 --> 05:17.580
♫Thousands of paths with flowers♫

05:13.330 --> 05:14.540
I don't want these.

05:16.180 --> 05:17.180
I only want you.

05:18.180 --> 05:18.940
You want me?

05:21.530 --> 05:22.780
It's okay.

05:23.140 --> 05:24.070
But actually...

05:24.380 --> 05:24.780
I'm

05:25.020 --> 05:26.260
not that expensive.

05:26.700 --> 05:28.160
I'm not worth 5,000 taels.

05:28.220 --> 05:29.350
1,000 taels will do.

05:29.380 --> 05:29.780
No.

05:30.820 --> 05:32.150
One copper coin will do.

05:34.540 --> 05:35.740
Lu Li sold himself to Liu Shao

05:35.740 --> 05:37.140
with one copper coin.

05:37.300 --> 05:38.360
Will you regret it?

05:38.620 --> 05:39.500
Never.

05:41.260 --> 05:42.980
Lu Li, you liar!

05:43.060 --> 05:44.260
Have you forgotten?

05:45.659 --> 05:47.580
I gave you one copper coin.

05:47.690 --> 05:51.610
♫Ask the flowing water whether it knows the red leaves♫

05:48.210 --> 05:50.180
Why do you break your promise?

05:51.610 --> 05:55.190
♫I miss you so much♫

05:51.659 --> 05:52.620
You can't cheat.

05:55.190 --> 05:57.659
♫I still remember the youth♫

05:58.420 --> 06:01.770
♫I laughed and hated getting old♫

06:00.620 --> 06:02.080
Go back to the mortal world

06:02.380 --> 06:04.440
and break the Soul-devouring Spell?

06:05.380 --> 06:07.310
I don't even remember these words.

06:10.380 --> 06:11.740
Now,

06:11.940 --> 06:14.620
you're just getting through the tribulation in the mortal world.

06:14.620 --> 06:15.970
After this,

06:18.580 --> 06:21.300
you will still be an immortal.

06:22.020 --> 06:23.550
Everyone will respect you.

06:27.930 --> 06:29.390
Everyone will respect me.

06:30.500 --> 06:32.180
It doesn't sound happy.

06:32.050 --> 06:34.870
♫Flowers bloom alone. The fragrance fills the path♫

06:34.870 --> 06:36.810
♫Look at the stars from faraway♫

06:37.159 --> 06:39.480
♫The chaos of knowing love♫

06:39.480 --> 06:42.300
♫The South Wind folds a little red♫

06:40.970 --> 06:42.620
I don't remember the past.

06:42.630 --> 06:45.770
♫Send you to the Western State♫

06:43.900 --> 06:45.180
Now,

06:46.820 --> 06:48.740
I'm just an ordinary

06:46.909 --> 06:49.670
♫Wild geese pass the mountains and the sea♫

06:49.620 --> 06:50.740
mortal person.

06:49.670 --> 06:51.970
♫I am rushing to a dream♫

06:51.460 --> 06:52.380
Liu Shao.

06:51.970 --> 06:54.200
♫The fate of three lifetimes♫

06:54.020 --> 06:55.300
I don't know why

06:54.200 --> 06:55.220
♫Appreciate with our hands tied♫

06:55.220 --> 07:01.080
♫Thousands of paths with flowers♫

06:59.020 --> 06:59.740
I

07:00.460 --> 07:01.340
don't want

07:01.620 --> 07:03.480
the immortal life you mentioned.

07:04.090 --> 07:05.770
The peace and happiness

07:06.460 --> 07:07.660
makes me feel at ease.

07:09.300 --> 07:09.970
Liu Shao.

07:11.210 --> 07:12.700
It's good to be like this.

07:15.700 --> 07:16.980
Stay with me in the mortal world.

07:16.400 --> 07:19.220
♫Flowers bloom alone. The fragrance fills the path♫

07:19.220 --> 07:21.160
♫Look at the stars from faraway♫

07:21.510 --> 07:23.830
♫The chaos of knowing love♫

07:22.620 --> 07:24.980
Because of your Sun Fragments,

07:23.830 --> 07:26.650
♫The South Wind folds a little red♫

07:25.340 --> 07:26.660
Ge is in great pain.

07:26.860 --> 07:29.500
The person you love is suffering because of you.

07:26.980 --> 07:30.120
♫Send you to the Western State♫

07:29.500 --> 07:31.860
Don't you feel sad?

07:31.260 --> 07:34.020
♫Wild geese pass the mountains and the sea♫

07:33.090 --> 07:34.659
It was me

07:34.020 --> 07:36.320
♫I am rushing to a dream♫

07:34.659 --> 07:36.180
who hurt you.

07:36.320 --> 07:38.550
♫The fate of three lifetimes♫

07:36.940 --> 07:37.780
Liu Shao,

07:37.860 --> 07:39.580
I have to face my responsibility

07:38.550 --> 07:39.570
♫Appreciate with our hands tied♫

07:39.570 --> 07:45.430
♫Thousands of paths with flowers♫.

07:39.780 --> 07:41.980
and get through the tribulation again.

07:43.940 --> 07:45.220
That's impossible.

07:47.460 --> 07:49.580
We are destined not to be together.

07:51.620 --> 07:54.020
Instead of fighting for what we want so desperately,

07:54.020 --> 07:55.570
we might as well let go.

08:00.540 --> 08:02.090
I'll take you to a place.

08:02.660 --> 08:04.780
See for yourself how the Three Realms

08:05.300 --> 08:06.540
need you.

08:25.980 --> 08:27.220
I'll go help them.

08:28.580 --> 08:29.180
This...

08:29.540 --> 08:30.470
What should I do?

08:40.820 --> 08:41.299
Well...

08:42.140 --> 08:43.820
Should I do something?

08:45.980 --> 08:47.980
It seems to be

08:49.020 --> 08:49.770
like this.

08:53.460 --> 08:54.260
It's useless.

08:59.620 --> 09:00.550
Let me try again.

09:08.490 --> 09:09.140
Brother.

09:11.460 --> 09:12.260
Help...

09:12.260 --> 09:12.740
Help me.

09:12.940 --> 09:13.780
Do something

09:14.500 --> 09:15.560
and send them away.

09:16.420 --> 09:16.890
Okay.

09:22.390 --> 09:22.940
Hurry up.

09:23.100 --> 09:23.500
Hurry!

09:38.330 --> 09:38.900
Liu Shao.

09:43.980 --> 09:46.020
My sister-in-law is really amazing.

09:46.020 --> 09:46.550
Brother.

09:46.580 --> 09:47.260
You...

09:48.300 --> 09:49.100
I remember

09:49.420 --> 09:50.550
that's how it works.

09:51.460 --> 09:53.300
Didn't sister-in-law say you went missing?

09:53.300 --> 09:54.380
Why are you here?

09:54.900 --> 09:56.940
You told me yesterday that you wanted to kill demons here.

09:56.940 --> 09:57.780
I found him

09:57.940 --> 09:59.140
and brought him here.

09:59.330 --> 10:00.060
Sister-in-law.

10:00.060 --> 10:00.620
Liu Shao.

10:00.940 --> 10:02.420
I saw you defeated them.

10:03.100 --> 10:03.830
Are you okay?

10:04.780 --> 10:05.710
Sister-in-law.

10:06.100 --> 10:07.630
What's wrong with brother?

10:07.660 --> 10:07.990
He...

10:08.860 --> 10:10.520
He has no magic power anymore?

10:12.220 --> 10:14.180
Something happened when Luo Ge was practicing.

10:14.180 --> 10:15.840
He doesn't remember the past.

10:15.900 --> 10:16.700
So

10:16.940 --> 10:18.340
he can't do magic for now.

10:21.940 --> 10:23.070
Who is your brother?

10:23.260 --> 10:23.980
You.

10:28.820 --> 10:29.810
Do you know

10:29.810 --> 10:31.420
you almost killed me?

10:31.890 --> 10:32.530
What?

10:33.260 --> 10:35.720
Do you want your sister-in-law to be a widow?

10:36.420 --> 10:36.980
Listen.

10:37.170 --> 10:38.060
This tone

10:38.060 --> 10:39.660
must be my brother's.

10:41.740 --> 10:42.300
But...

10:42.420 --> 10:43.500
What's going on?

10:44.090 --> 10:45.940
Many people have been missing in the city these days.

10:45.940 --> 10:47.940
Jian and I came to investigate this.

10:48.060 --> 10:49.860
We found that some demons were killing people to get the vitality.

10:49.860 --> 10:51.020
So we came to save people.

10:51.020 --> 10:52.930
I didn't expect those demons are so cunning

10:52.930 --> 10:53.790
to ambush here.

10:55.010 --> 10:55.780
I...

10:56.540 --> 10:57.620
I didn't help much.

10:58.220 --> 10:59.100
Looks like

10:59.580 --> 11:01.300
I have to learn some magic.

11:02.260 --> 11:04.320
I wanted to protect you guys, but now,

11:04.690 --> 11:06.570
I can only rely on you to protect me.

11:06.570 --> 11:07.140
Brother,

11:07.820 --> 11:09.620
you have protected many people.

11:09.780 --> 11:10.980
The whole human world

11:11.020 --> 11:12.020
should thank you.

11:16.980 --> 11:17.660
Liu Shao.

11:23.940 --> 11:24.740
Master Shang.

11:26.380 --> 11:27.340
You found him?

11:28.940 --> 11:29.420
Who is this?

11:29.420 --> 11:30.100
If he doesn't go back,

11:30.100 --> 11:30.700
I don't know.

11:30.700 --> 11:31.470
we'll be in trouble.

11:31.470 --> 11:34.300
-You don't know him either? -He doesn't seem to remember anything.

11:34.300 --> 11:35.180
No.

11:35.860 --> 11:36.740
Please

11:36.900 --> 11:38.220
tell the immortals that

11:38.220 --> 11:39.950
I will take Immortal Luo Ge back

11:40.460 --> 11:42.190
to the Immortal Palace safely.

11:42.730 --> 11:43.260
Liu Shao,

11:44.860 --> 11:46.380
who is this pretty?

11:47.100 --> 11:48.380
He looks quite gentle.

11:48.500 --> 11:50.430
But he's wearing too much make-up.

11:51.820 --> 11:52.580
Luo Ge,

11:52.900 --> 11:53.980
look at you.

11:54.060 --> 11:55.260
You're still so mean.

11:55.900 --> 11:56.660
Look carefully.

11:56.660 --> 11:57.900
Look carefully.

11:58.180 --> 11:59.740
I was born beautiful.

11:59.740 --> 12:01.420
I don't wear makeup.

12:01.820 --> 12:02.540
Master Shang,

12:02.540 --> 12:04.060
are you here to catch up with us?

12:04.060 --> 12:04.570
No.

12:05.140 --> 12:05.700
I have something important

12:05.700 --> 12:06.620
to ask you.

12:06.700 --> 12:07.830
Please come with me.

12:10.340 --> 12:10.870
Liu Shao.

12:15.540 --> 12:16.130
What?

12:16.580 --> 12:19.060
The evil spirit of the Four Seasons Monument is emitting again?

12:19.060 --> 12:19.500
Yes.

12:20.180 --> 12:21.180
Luo Ge is not here.

12:21.660 --> 12:23.120
Only your Blood Amulet can

12:23.890 --> 12:25.490
hold back these evil things.

12:29.540 --> 12:30.260
I know.

12:31.340 --> 12:33.000
How many are you going to take?

12:35.050 --> 12:36.250
I will take one first.

12:36.460 --> 12:37.990
It will work for three days.

12:38.100 --> 12:39.140
I hope you can

12:39.250 --> 12:40.060
help him

12:40.380 --> 12:42.740
get him through the tribulation in three days.

12:42.740 --> 12:43.540
Otherwise...

12:45.020 --> 12:45.620
Liu Shao.

12:46.060 --> 12:47.590
I know this is unfair to you.

12:52.820 --> 12:54.060
If I had other ways,

12:55.650 --> 12:57.180
I wouldn't have come to you.

12:57.380 --> 12:58.240
Without Luo Ge,

12:59.500 --> 13:01.500
can the talisman pearl suppress it?

13:02.140 --> 13:03.100
A talisman pearl

13:03.300 --> 13:06.100
can only last three more days for the Three Realms.

13:06.540 --> 13:07.540
Just wait and see.

13:09.060 --> 13:10.520
If Luo Ge doesn't come back

13:10.700 --> 13:11.900
in three days,

13:15.140 --> 13:17.580
the Four Seasons Monument will be completely out of control.

13:17.580 --> 13:19.440
The Three Realms will be in chaos.

13:30.340 --> 13:31.500
Take one first.

13:33.260 --> 13:36.260
I'll try to help Luo Ge recall the past.

13:38.300 --> 13:39.580
We can only rely on you

13:41.100 --> 13:42.660
for the next three days.

13:51.220 --> 13:51.740
Sorry.

13:54.220 --> 13:54.980
Liu Shao.

13:55.780 --> 13:56.570
Liu Shao.

14:03.220 --> 14:04.340
Liu Shao.

14:06.140 --> 14:07.460
Liu Shao.

14:08.820 --> 14:10.140
Where are you?

14:15.290 --> 14:16.090
Master Shang.

14:17.260 --> 14:17.980
Please

14:19.220 --> 14:21.140
cast a Silence Spell on me.

14:21.540 --> 14:22.660
I'm afraid

14:23.220 --> 14:24.620
I'll scream in pain.

14:24.980 --> 14:26.500
He will be sad

14:27.340 --> 14:28.600
when he hears my voice.

14:29.660 --> 14:30.180
Okay.

14:31.580 --> 14:34.180
This will be the fifth talisman pearl from you.

14:34.300 --> 14:36.260
It will hurt your vitality.

14:37.380 --> 14:38.110
You'd better

14:38.860 --> 14:40.990
take good care of yourself after this.

14:42.580 --> 14:43.310
Don't worry.

15:19.220 --> 15:20.900
Liu Shao.

15:39.530 --> 15:41.700
Liu Shao.

16:07.260 --> 16:08.860
I can't even protect Liu Shao

16:09.380 --> 16:10.700
with no magic power.

16:12.460 --> 16:13.590
Is this the feeling?

16:22.300 --> 16:22.860
Liu Shao.

16:24.300 --> 16:24.830
Liu Shao.

16:26.100 --> 16:26.900
What's wrong?

16:28.140 --> 16:29.200
Why are you so weak?

16:29.770 --> 16:30.900
Where have you been?

16:32.540 --> 16:33.260
I’m fine.

16:33.860 --> 16:35.980
I just talked to Master Shang

16:37.020 --> 16:38.100
and fell down.

16:38.180 --> 16:38.860
You fell?

16:40.580 --> 16:41.840
Did you hurt yourself?

16:43.140 --> 16:43.900
No.

16:45.140 --> 16:45.980
Can you

16:46.500 --> 16:47.630
carry me for a while?

16:47.860 --> 16:48.260
Okay.

17:21.819 --> 17:23.420
Did Luo Ge do anything to you?

17:23.740 --> 17:25.339
He probably wants to kill me.

17:25.819 --> 17:26.290
But

17:26.380 --> 17:27.440
he has no power now.

17:27.540 --> 17:29.000
There is nothing he can do.

17:29.420 --> 17:30.500
You are showing off.

17:30.500 --> 17:32.100
He will make you pay for this.

17:32.260 --> 17:32.940
Seal it now.

17:33.020 --> 17:33.460
Okay.

17:33.940 --> 17:35.180
That pretty.

17:35.220 --> 17:36.700
Isn't he asking for death?

17:36.860 --> 17:38.460
My sister-in-law hurt so bad

17:38.490 --> 17:39.780
after he took her out for a while.

17:39.780 --> 17:40.310
Exactly.

17:40.460 --> 17:41.300
Immortal Luo Ge.

17:41.300 --> 17:42.540
When you regain your power,

17:42.540 --> 17:43.580
you have to peel him.

17:43.580 --> 17:43.900
Yes.

17:44.100 --> 17:45.210
Hang him on the wall

17:45.300 --> 17:46.020
for three days.

17:46.020 --> 17:46.300
Yes.

17:46.980 --> 17:47.420
I will.

17:48.020 --> 17:49.100
I said it was me.

17:56.420 --> 17:58.100
Greetings, Senior Lu.

17:58.340 --> 18:00.420
Greetings, Immortal Luo Ge.

18:01.140 --> 18:01.670
Liu Shao.

18:02.700 --> 18:03.620
They are...

18:05.100 --> 18:06.340
They are thanking you

18:06.780 --> 18:08.020
for saving the mortal world.

18:08.020 --> 18:08.980
Thank me?

18:09.380 --> 18:10.780
The Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

18:10.780 --> 18:12.220
was occupied by the Demon Realm.

18:12.220 --> 18:15.020
The mortal world almost became a part of the Demon Realm.

18:15.020 --> 18:16.140
You rebuilt

18:16.500 --> 18:18.810
the Marquis Wuyang's Mansion by yourself

18:18.810 --> 18:21.620
and gave the elites of the mortal world a place to recuperate

18:21.620 --> 18:23.420
and rebuilt the order of the mortal world.

18:23.420 --> 18:23.860
Yes.

18:26.260 --> 18:28.180
My brother is the hero of the Three Realms,

18:28.180 --> 18:30.040
the guardian of the Three Realms.

18:34.900 --> 18:35.940
Get up.

18:41.300 --> 18:42.760
Do you remember anything?

18:44.100 --> 18:44.700
No.

18:48.450 --> 18:49.450
I'm just thinking

18:50.740 --> 18:51.860
how a couple

18:52.900 --> 18:54.300
live in the mortal world?

18:54.980 --> 18:55.580
Wang Jian,

18:56.020 --> 18:56.900
how did you

18:56.900 --> 18:57.780
live?

18:58.540 --> 18:59.620
Just like that.

19:00.210 --> 19:01.490
You build a few huts,

19:02.060 --> 19:03.060
do some farm work,

19:03.460 --> 19:05.260
and raise a few ducks. Is it hard?

19:05.580 --> 19:06.580
No, no.

19:08.100 --> 19:08.830
That's good.

19:09.660 --> 19:10.390
That's good.

19:12.540 --> 19:13.270
That's good.

19:14.290 --> 19:15.020
That's good.

19:15.420 --> 19:16.140
Luo Ge.

19:17.060 --> 19:19.500
When will you remember who you are?

19:26.780 --> 19:29.060
I made a promise with the Immortal before.

19:29.060 --> 19:30.790
After I subdue the Four Demons,

19:31.020 --> 19:32.880
the Immortal will return Fu to me.

19:33.260 --> 19:34.900
Now the Four Demons have been subdued

19:34.900 --> 19:36.300
and have made me the king.

19:36.540 --> 19:38.300
Please keep your promise.

19:39.140 --> 19:41.210
Immortal is getting through the tribulation.

19:41.210 --> 19:42.180
We can't decide

19:42.860 --> 19:44.570
what he promised.

19:46.100 --> 19:47.540
The thunder stroke

19:47.820 --> 19:49.740
and the Xiyin Mountain is descending.

19:49.740 --> 19:51.940
Is Immortal really getting through the tribulation?

19:51.940 --> 19:52.580
He Na.

19:55.300 --> 19:56.860
This is the Immortal Palace's business.

19:56.860 --> 19:57.860
You crossed the line.

19:57.860 --> 19:59.660
The Three Realms are related as a whole.

19:59.660 --> 20:02.190
If there is any change in the Immortal Palace,

20:02.780 --> 20:04.860
the Demons will be affected.

20:07.300 --> 20:07.740
Fine.

20:07.980 --> 20:09.620
The Immortal Palace will keep our promises.

20:09.620 --> 20:10.220
Follow me.

20:38.380 --> 20:39.380
He's not Fu.

20:41.260 --> 20:42.060
We wanted to

20:42.260 --> 20:44.500
free Fu back to the Demon Realm.

20:45.060 --> 20:45.980
But he escaped.

20:46.540 --> 20:47.600
This is different.

21:09.980 --> 21:11.240
It belongs to Luo Ning.

21:11.900 --> 21:12.760
Could it be that

21:12.860 --> 21:14.920
she was abducted by your brother too?

21:16.340 --> 21:17.940
It belongs to Fairy Luo Ning.

21:19.220 --> 21:20.380
Don't worry.

21:20.660 --> 21:22.460
I'll find Fu and ask him

21:22.860 --> 21:24.460
and give you an explanation.

21:29.410 --> 21:30.470
Hurry up! Hurry up!

21:30.660 --> 21:32.100
Brother, sister-in-law.

21:32.100 --> 21:32.700
Brother.

21:32.900 --> 21:33.460
Chicken.

21:33.700 --> 21:34.230
Rabbits.

21:34.300 --> 21:35.300
Pomegranate tree

21:35.660 --> 21:36.790
and peach blossoms.

21:37.260 --> 21:37.860
Brother,

21:38.220 --> 21:38.950
what you want

21:39.020 --> 21:40.150
is like this, right?

21:43.290 --> 21:44.090
Do you like it?

21:46.540 --> 21:48.330
I've never lived in a place like this.

21:48.330 --> 21:50.380
And I've never raised chicken and ducks.

21:50.380 --> 21:50.940
But

21:52.330 --> 21:53.260
I like it.

21:55.340 --> 21:56.260
That's good.

21:56.930 --> 21:57.740
Brother, sister-in-law,

21:57.740 --> 21:59.540
you can stay here in peace from now on.

21:59.540 --> 22:00.340
Xue,

22:00.500 --> 22:02.140
let's cook some delicious dishes

22:02.140 --> 22:03.820
to welcome them tonight.

22:03.890 --> 22:04.550
No problem.

22:05.260 --> 22:05.790
Let's go.

22:06.100 --> 22:06.700
Slow down.

22:08.930 --> 22:10.060
What should we cook?

22:10.580 --> 22:11.780
Pick the vegetables.

22:13.700 --> 22:14.360
How are you?

22:15.260 --> 22:16.590
Are you feeling better?

22:17.900 --> 22:18.780
I'm fine.

22:20.020 --> 22:21.020
It's just that...

22:22.220 --> 22:24.550
you still have a lot of responsibilities.

22:24.690 --> 22:25.380
Luo Ge.

22:26.420 --> 22:27.260
You're an immortal.

22:27.260 --> 22:28.220
I'm a mortal.

22:29.580 --> 22:30.570
I can't do magic.

22:31.740 --> 22:32.470
Even if I can,

22:33.460 --> 22:34.380
I will protect

22:35.620 --> 22:36.950
the person I care about.

22:38.580 --> 22:39.810
The Three Realms are too much.

22:39.810 --> 22:40.740
I can't bear it.

22:42.130 --> 22:42.660
Let's go.

22:43.220 --> 22:44.140
Help them cook.

22:46.700 --> 22:47.230
Let's go.

23:01.380 --> 23:02.540
You see how cute

23:02.540 --> 23:03.670
these two goats are.

23:03.980 --> 23:04.510
Hurry up.

23:04.620 --> 23:05.100
Keep up.

23:05.380 --> 23:07.660
Is this the important thing you mentioned?

23:07.660 --> 23:09.500
You've been weak lately.

23:10.060 --> 23:11.300
When they grow up,

23:11.580 --> 23:13.240
they can produce milk for you.

23:14.050 --> 23:14.900
Let's live our life

23:14.900 --> 23:16.100
in the yard.

23:16.100 --> 23:17.760
I will plant some vegetables.

23:18.380 --> 23:19.580
By then,

23:19.740 --> 23:21.340
I'll plow the soil in the yard

23:21.980 --> 23:23.420
and plant some vegetables.

23:23.420 --> 23:24.180
The vegetables

23:24.180 --> 23:25.510
must be very delicious.

23:28.700 --> 23:30.060
Let's go.

23:37.580 --> 23:39.980
You seem to remember what Lu Li promised me.

23:41.300 --> 23:43.740
But if you can't remember Luo Ge's past,

23:44.420 --> 23:46.880
how can you break the Soul-Devouring Spell?

23:52.020 --> 23:54.020
I wonder where my brother is.

23:54.660 --> 23:56.180
The mortal world is so big.

23:56.460 --> 23:58.460
I don't know where to find him.

23:59.340 --> 24:01.380
Immortal Luo Ge is blessed by God.

24:01.770 --> 24:02.810
He will be happy

24:03.060 --> 24:04.390
that you care about him.

24:08.580 --> 24:09.130
Come on.

24:09.130 --> 24:09.970
What do you like?

24:09.970 --> 24:10.630
Take a look.

24:10.810 --> 24:11.140
Take a look.

24:11.140 --> 24:12.400
What do you want to buy?

24:27.340 --> 24:28.270
Are you okay, Fu?

24:31.020 --> 24:31.580
I'm fine.

24:34.780 --> 24:35.420
Let's go.

24:38.500 --> 24:39.060
Fu.

24:39.170 --> 24:40.060
Look over there.

24:40.060 --> 24:40.590
Let's go.

24:40.650 --> 24:41.050
Go.

24:41.580 --> 24:41.900
Go!

24:42.820 --> 24:43.220
Miss! Miss!

24:43.220 --> 24:44.210
Take mine.

24:44.380 --> 24:44.740
My fan is good.

24:44.740 --> 24:45.470
Mine is good.

24:46.620 --> 24:47.300
Look at mine.

24:47.300 --> 24:47.660
Miss.

24:47.740 --> 24:48.470
Look at mine.

24:52.980 --> 24:55.380
I know the custom of your Dusting Festival.

24:56.940 --> 24:57.940
Giving a fan

24:58.220 --> 24:59.820
to express your love, right?

25:01.340 --> 25:02.270
Unfortunately,

25:03.100 --> 25:04.500
I'm only interested in

25:05.100 --> 25:05.980
your hearts.

25:09.380 --> 25:09.900
Fu.

25:10.460 --> 25:11.100
Look.

25:11.380 --> 25:13.260
There are many beautiful fans here.

25:13.260 --> 25:14.790
Choose one and give it to me.

25:18.100 --> 25:19.380
Okay?

25:21.700 --> 25:22.340
Okay.

25:22.660 --> 25:23.720
I'll buy it for you.

25:23.980 --> 25:25.640
You can buy whatever you want,

25:25.780 --> 25:27.710
as long as you don't accept theirs.

25:29.060 --> 25:31.390
Do you think I'll take things from anyone?

25:31.820 --> 25:32.480
Take a look.

25:33.060 --> 25:33.420
Okay.

25:34.460 --> 25:35.340
Take a look.

25:35.580 --> 25:36.900
This fan is beautiful.

25:37.420 --> 25:38.620
Which one do you want?

25:41.260 --> 25:42.060
So beautiful.

25:42.260 --> 25:43.060
Do you like it?

25:45.020 --> 25:45.660
Fu,

25:45.700 --> 25:46.060
look.

25:50.340 --> 25:50.900
Welcome.

25:50.980 --> 25:51.580
Have a look.

25:51.580 --> 25:52.060
Fu.

25:53.260 --> 25:54.220
If I wear this,

25:54.410 --> 25:56.340
no one will come to give me a fan.

25:57.580 --> 25:58.300
Well,

26:03.140 --> 26:04.340
I'll choose this one.

26:05.500 --> 26:07.410
If someone dares to give you a fan,

26:07.700 --> 26:08.830
I can scare them away

26:08.900 --> 26:10.140
like this.

26:11.260 --> 26:11.980
Fu,

26:12.100 --> 26:13.580
You look ugly in this.

26:14.900 --> 26:15.700
Let me see you.

26:15.860 --> 26:16.420
Look.

26:18.300 --> 26:19.760
My little fairy is pretty.

26:21.340 --> 26:22.540
I will take these two.

26:22.740 --> 26:23.340
Thank you.

26:24.450 --> 26:24.940
Fu,

26:25.140 --> 26:26.020
let's go there.

26:26.220 --> 26:26.750
Let's go.

26:27.060 --> 26:27.660
Thank you.

26:32.540 --> 26:33.490
There are people

26:34.220 --> 26:35.020
who chose Demon King and Immortal Ze Shui's masks

26:35.020 --> 26:36.980
these days.

26:43.500 --> 26:45.500
I will go to the mortal world myself.

26:46.780 --> 26:47.220
Also,

26:48.020 --> 26:49.420
no one can know

26:49.860 --> 26:51.140
about Fu's escape.

26:51.380 --> 26:53.310
I'm afraid something will happen.

26:53.420 --> 26:54.020
Yes.

26:59.740 --> 27:00.460
Fu,

27:00.810 --> 27:02.220
I spoiled you too much

27:02.540 --> 27:03.980
and let you cause troubles

27:03.980 --> 27:04.940
every time.

27:06.220 --> 27:07.500
What would you do

27:08.020 --> 27:10.280
if the Immortal Palace intervenes in it?

27:10.390 --> 27:15.140
[Qianyuan Tea House]

27:12.260 --> 27:12.980
Guests,

27:13.100 --> 27:14.180
here is the water. Enjoy.

27:14.180 --> 27:14.780
Thank you.

27:21.170 --> 27:21.900
Drink it.

27:24.330 --> 27:25.330
It smells so good.

27:32.860 --> 27:34.390
You want to eat almond cake?

27:34.900 --> 27:36.100
I have never tried it.

27:36.420 --> 27:37.480
I'll buy it for you.

27:37.780 --> 27:38.210
Okay.

27:43.320 --> 27:45.750
[Fortune-telling]

27:49.580 --> 27:50.020
Miss,

27:51.020 --> 27:52.620
do you need a fortune teller?

27:52.740 --> 27:53.380
No.

27:54.340 --> 27:55.060
Then...

27:55.340 --> 27:57.060
Are you looking for...

27:58.380 --> 27:59.980
Are you looking for someone?

28:01.740 --> 28:02.860
You know this?

28:06.140 --> 28:07.820
Just focus on the compass

28:08.580 --> 28:11.180
and think about the person you are looking for.

28:11.410 --> 28:12.660
This compass

28:13.180 --> 28:15.580
will show you

28:16.220 --> 28:17.820
the direction of the person.

29:20.540 --> 29:25.000
[Qianyuan Tea House]

29:35.870 --> 29:37.430
[Fortune-telling]

29:44.340 --> 29:46.000
I've been looking for so long.

29:46.220 --> 29:48.820
I finally found a person with spiritual power.

29:49.380 --> 29:51.380
After I take the vitality out of her,

29:51.620 --> 29:52.340
I believe

29:53.780 --> 29:55.850
Master will be very happy.

30:25.580 --> 30:26.700
How dare you hurt her?

30:26.700 --> 30:27.700
Do you want to die?

30:29.540 --> 30:30.090
Luo Ning.

30:30.930 --> 30:32.130
Luo Ning, how are you?

30:35.100 --> 30:36.020
Fu.

30:37.100 --> 30:38.140
It hurts.

30:39.020 --> 30:39.740
Where?

30:39.940 --> 30:40.470
Luo Ning.

30:43.780 --> 30:44.500
Watch out!

30:50.460 --> 30:51.060
Brother.

30:56.980 --> 30:58.580
People died after being taken off the vitality

30:58.580 --> 31:00.780
in the mortal world recently.

31:01.340 --> 31:02.700
It seems that

31:03.290 --> 31:04.740
the collapse of the market is because of you guys.

31:04.740 --> 31:05.220
Tell me.

31:06.100 --> 31:07.580
Who asked you

31:07.660 --> 31:09.720
to collect the vitality everywhere?

31:14.500 --> 31:15.260
Demon King.

31:15.690 --> 31:16.300
I...

31:27.860 --> 31:29.190
It's evil spirit again.

31:29.300 --> 31:30.540
Could it be the Luo Ge

31:31.740 --> 31:33.330
in the Four Seasons Monument?

31:33.330 --> 31:36.330
The Four Seasons Monument is getting more dangerous.

31:39.260 --> 31:39.860
Fu.

31:39.940 --> 31:40.580
Brother.

31:40.690 --> 31:41.460
Are you okay?

31:41.740 --> 31:42.340
I'm fine.

31:43.420 --> 31:43.950
Luo Ning.

31:52.100 --> 31:52.740
This is...

31:54.660 --> 31:55.190
Luo Ning.

31:55.900 --> 31:56.500
It's fine.

31:56.700 --> 31:57.360
Don't move.

32:00.660 --> 32:01.290
Fairy.

32:06.540 --> 32:07.170
Fu,

32:07.260 --> 32:08.380
go back to the Demon Palace

32:08.380 --> 32:09.460
and leave Fairy to me.

32:09.460 --> 32:11.540
I'll take her back to the Immortal Palace.

32:11.540 --> 32:12.100
No way.

32:13.140 --> 32:13.940
Fu.

32:14.180 --> 32:15.420
She's Luo Ge's sister.

32:15.420 --> 32:17.420
She's not someone you can bring out.

32:18.500 --> 32:21.230
Are you afraid of offending the Immortal Palace?

32:21.340 --> 32:22.220
The Immortal Palace is in turmoil.

32:22.220 --> 32:23.420
The Three Realms are in turmoil.

32:23.420 --> 32:24.780
Stop causing trouble.

32:25.140 --> 32:26.470
But it's Fairy Luo Ning.

32:26.730 --> 32:27.730
I won't let her go.

32:28.700 --> 32:30.930
Besides, she has helped the Aquatic Demons.

32:30.930 --> 32:31.930
I want to keep her.

32:31.940 --> 32:32.700
Fu!

32:35.130 --> 32:35.820
Fu.

33:10.180 --> 33:10.820
So...

33:13.700 --> 33:14.900
So Fairy Luo Ning

33:16.220 --> 33:18.350
is really the heir of Immortal Ze Shui.

33:57.740 --> 33:59.200
Here, take your medicine.

34:10.659 --> 34:11.340
Fu.

34:12.540 --> 34:13.620
That demon

34:13.780 --> 34:15.440
devoured half of my vitality.

34:15.980 --> 34:17.179
Ordinary medicine

34:18.020 --> 34:19.380
can't save me.

34:19.980 --> 34:21.540
I've thought about it.

34:22.179 --> 34:25.239
Send me back to the Immortal Palace as soon as possible.

34:25.340 --> 34:26.139
I'm afraid...

34:26.460 --> 34:28.170
if something happens to me,

34:28.610 --> 34:29.940
you will be implicated.

34:30.340 --> 34:32.739
I'm not afraid of the Immortal Palace. I...

34:34.620 --> 34:35.380
I mean

34:36.420 --> 34:37.699
I brought you here.

34:38.620 --> 34:39.620
I will cure you.

34:40.460 --> 34:40.860
No.

34:41.739 --> 34:43.800
I insisted on looking for my brother.

34:43.820 --> 34:45.420
It has nothing to do with you.

34:46.219 --> 34:48.080
As long as I can find my brother...

34:49.780 --> 34:50.449
But...

34:51.500 --> 34:53.500
I don't know where my brother is now.

34:53.739 --> 34:55.270
I'm afraid we can't find him

34:55.340 --> 34:56.860
for a while.

35:01.700 --> 35:03.500
Don't think about your brother.

35:03.690 --> 35:05.020
Take care of yourself.

35:05.460 --> 35:06.060
I'm here.

35:07.460 --> 35:09.260
There's nothing to be afraid of.

35:19.580 --> 35:20.420
Fu.

35:28.260 --> 35:29.720
Your vitality is damaged.

35:30.940 --> 35:32.300
You just need to

35:32.820 --> 35:34.680
make up for the damaged vitality.

35:34.860 --> 35:35.590
Don't worry.

35:38.780 --> 35:40.140
Fu.

35:40.660 --> 35:42.020
Long time no see.

35:42.540 --> 35:43.220
It's you.

35:43.980 --> 35:45.180
God of the Moonlight.

35:45.620 --> 35:47.780
I didn't expect you to be able to convey messages with your mind.

35:47.780 --> 35:49.090
I have to

35:49.500 --> 35:50.700
thank

35:50.900 --> 35:52.980
the fairy with you.

35:53.580 --> 35:55.420
Thanks to the half of her vitality,

35:55.420 --> 35:57.890
it's more nutritious than thousands of the mortals.

35:57.890 --> 35:58.980
It's really you.

35:59.700 --> 36:00.630
I'm warning you.

36:01.020 --> 36:02.700
Don't hurt Luo Ning again.

36:03.300 --> 36:04.060
Also,

36:04.660 --> 36:06.190
when you regain your power,

36:06.420 --> 36:08.020
don't forget your promise.

36:09.540 --> 36:10.820
Brat,

36:11.380 --> 36:13.580
I will let you know

36:13.900 --> 36:17.060
the difference between the king and the subordinate.

36:25.850 --> 36:26.380
Good boy.

36:27.900 --> 36:29.100
You feed the rabbits and goats

36:29.100 --> 36:30.690
before breakfast?

36:31.500 --> 36:33.060
I also checked

36:33.060 --> 36:34.520
whether the seeds sprout.

36:34.580 --> 36:35.840
Time passes so slowly.

36:36.540 --> 36:38.500
It's only been two days.

36:40.420 --> 36:41.620
It's been three days.

36:43.580 --> 36:44.580
Three days.

36:47.540 --> 36:48.800
On the first day we met,

36:49.540 --> 36:50.850
we rowed at Moon River

36:51.540 --> 36:53.580
and then went to Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

36:53.580 --> 36:56.180
You took me to the Moon Washing Pond yesterday.

36:56.540 --> 36:57.540
What about today?

36:58.820 --> 37:00.080
Where will we go today?

37:02.380 --> 37:04.660
Wherever you want to go.

37:05.180 --> 37:06.940
Do you remember anything these days?

37:06.940 --> 37:07.540
Liu Shao.

37:08.820 --> 37:09.950
I know you're trying

37:10.140 --> 37:11.470
to remind me of the past.

37:12.180 --> 37:13.640
But I've thought about it.

37:14.610 --> 37:16.460
From the first day I came here,

37:17.100 --> 37:19.300
I felt like I was looking for something.

37:20.340 --> 37:20.940
But

37:21.380 --> 37:23.640
I knew I found it from the moment I saw you.

37:24.340 --> 37:25.100
I don't want to

37:25.100 --> 37:26.100
be some immortal.

37:26.200 --> 37:28.260
I just want to live with you like this.

37:28.980 --> 37:29.840
Anything else?

37:30.620 --> 37:31.540
Well,

37:32.180 --> 37:34.420
Wang Jian wants to improve his skills.

37:35.140 --> 37:36.400
He wants me to help him.

37:39.220 --> 37:40.650
I have an idea

37:40.980 --> 37:42.460
to realize all of these

37:42.460 --> 37:43.900
within one day.

37:45.140 --> 37:45.690
Tell me.

37:47.140 --> 37:48.470
Let go of your obsession

37:49.340 --> 37:50.740
and become the Immortal.

37:51.540 --> 37:52.470
The Three Realms

37:53.260 --> 37:54.860
will be under your control.

37:58.220 --> 38:02.020
If I want to regain my memory, I need to return to the Immortal Palace.

38:02.730 --> 38:03.590
What about you?

38:04.020 --> 38:05.080
Where would you be?

38:17.100 --> 38:18.960
You always want me to find my past.

38:19.940 --> 38:21.100
But what I want

38:21.580 --> 38:22.740
is you.

38:24.260 --> 38:25.720
I don't want to get through

38:26.180 --> 38:27.180
the tribulation.

38:32.420 --> 38:33.950
If you don't want to face it,

38:34.740 --> 38:36.400
then wait for three more days.

38:37.540 --> 38:38.600
Make your decision

38:40.180 --> 38:41.180
after three days.

38:43.180 --> 38:44.380
Let alone three days,

38:44.660 --> 38:46.460
even if it's three or thirty years,

38:46.460 --> 38:47.920
I'll have the same answer.

38:49.140 --> 38:51.000
I don't want to be Immortal Luo Ge.

38:51.420 --> 38:52.820
I just want to be a mortal.

38:53.420 --> 38:55.420
But I don't have that much time left.

38:58.260 --> 38:59.050
Luo Ge.

38:59.860 --> 39:00.780
Three days.

39:02.540 --> 39:03.470
Just three days.

39:07.260 --> 39:09.100
What if I disappear one day

39:10.300 --> 39:12.690
and you can't find me?

39:13.420 --> 39:14.280
Don't you dare.

39:14.940 --> 39:15.580
Try me.

39:23.260 --> 39:23.940
Sorry.

39:24.860 --> 39:25.420
Luo Ge.

39:26.900 --> 39:28.500
If you still can't remember,

39:29.700 --> 39:32.360
let me help you fulfill your responsibilities.

39:40.740 --> 39:41.870
It's just three days

39:42.180 --> 39:43.700
and the talisman pearl couldn't stop it.

39:43.700 --> 39:45.560
Even the formation is weakening.

39:46.300 --> 39:48.230
We don't have the eye of formation.

39:48.540 --> 39:49.740
The eye of formation?

39:51.700 --> 39:53.140
The location of Liu Shao

39:53.500 --> 39:54.830
is the eye of formation.

39:56.100 --> 39:58.030
Although Liu Shao is not powerful,

39:58.220 --> 39:59.900
she has the power of the Sun Spirit.

39:59.900 --> 40:01.830
So she can suppress the formation.

40:02.020 --> 40:03.380
Besides, this formation

40:03.380 --> 40:04.860
was set by Luo Ge.

40:05.220 --> 40:06.500
Even without the eye of formation,

40:06.500 --> 40:08.630
it's more powerful than my formation.

40:08.980 --> 40:11.840
Now the formation has been corroded by evil spirit.

40:11.970 --> 40:13.230
If anything happens to

40:13.780 --> 40:14.980
the person who guards the eye of formation,

40:14.980 --> 40:17.380
the person will be devoured by evil spirit.

40:18.620 --> 40:19.300
I will go.

40:20.260 --> 40:21.380
The Immortal Palace

40:21.380 --> 40:23.240
should be led by you young people.

40:23.860 --> 40:25.380
Immortal Master is highly respected.

40:25.380 --> 40:27.580
You'd better take charge of the situation here.

40:27.580 --> 40:29.580
I've been enjoying the undeserved reputation of the head of the Palaces

40:29.580 --> 40:30.780
for a long time.

40:37.260 --> 40:38.300
I'm your senior.

40:38.650 --> 40:41.110
It's not your turn to be the eye of formation.

40:41.900 --> 40:43.140
Go and see Luo Ge.

40:43.540 --> 40:44.540
This tribulation

40:44.580 --> 40:45.780
is not only about him.

40:46.180 --> 40:47.440
He must get through it.

40:48.500 --> 40:49.100
Okay.

40:50.180 --> 40:52.860
If he can't get through this tribulation,

40:52.860 --> 40:55.320
you must take the sixth talisman pearl back.

40:56.180 --> 40:58.020
But after taking the sixth talisman pearl,

40:58.020 --> 40:59.680
I'm afraid Liu Shao will be...

41:00.340 --> 41:01.980
I'll take the Ancient Herb and Glazed Fruit

41:01.980 --> 41:02.900
to her.

41:08.180 --> 41:09.260
Master Zhuo.

41:10.060 --> 41:10.780
We're counting on you.
